      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Whenever Mel uses an ability, she gains three bonus projectiles (up to nine maximum) on her next attack. When Mel deals damage through an ability or attack, she applies Overwhelm, which can stack infinitely. If the enemy is hit by Mel with enough Overwhelm damage, the stacks are consumed to execute the target.",
      "summary_zh": "每当梅尔使用技能，她的下一次攻击将额外附带3枚弹体（最多9枚）。 当梅尔通过一次技能或攻击造成伤害时，她会施加【夺命残影】——一种可以无限叠加的效果。如果目标身上叠加了足够的夺命残影伤害量，则会在下一次被梅尔命中时被直接处决，同时消耗效果层数。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1682830:4038410"
      ]
